B.bbw=s(["**In transit:** all communication between the app and backend uses TLS 1.2 or higher.","**At rest:** Firestore encrypts all data by default (AES-256).","**Passwords:** stored only as a hash by Firebase Authentication (scrypt). We have no access to plaintext passwords.","**Local PIN:** stored as SHA-256 hash with random salt in Keychain (iOS) / Keystore (Android). Never leaves the device.","**Biometrics:** Face ID / Touch ID are handled by the OS. Fintab never receives or stores biometric data.","**Firestore security rules:** each user can only read and write data tied to their own UID."],t.s)
B.acl=new A.cN(B.bbw,!1)
B.bcH=s(["Transa\xe7\xf5es (t\xedtulo, valor, tipo, categoria, data, descri\xe7\xe3o, carteira, tags)","Carteiras/contas (nome, \xedcone, cor, moeda, tipo, saldo inicial)","Categorias personalizadas","Or\xe7amentos (limites por categoria, m\xeas/ano)","Metas financeiras (t\xedtulo, valor-alvo, prazo)","Transa\xe7\xf5es recorrentes (Pro)"],t.s)
B.acm=new A.cN(B.bcH,!1)
B.bdl=s(["Email (email/password signup, Sign in with Apple, or Google Sign-In)","Display name (when provided by the login provider)","Profile photo URL (when provided by the login provider)","Unique UID generated by Firebase Authentication","Password (email signup only; stored **only as a hash** by Firebase \u2014 we never access plaintext passwords)"],t.s)
B.acn=new A.cN(B.bdl,!1)
B.beN=s(["**Enquanto sua conta estiver ativa:** mantemos todos os dados para o funcionamento do app.","**Ap\xf3s exclus\xe3o da conta:** os dados pessoais e financeiros vinculados ao seu UID s\xe3o apagados do Firestore em **at\xe9 30 dias**. Backups operacionais do Google Cloud expiram em at\xe9 **90 dias** adicionais.","**Logs t\xe9cnicos de autentica\xe7\xe3o** (Firebase Auth) s\xe3o retidos pelo Firebase pelo per\xedodo padr\xe3o da Google.","**Dados locais** no dispositivo somem ao desinstalar o app."],t.s)
B.aco=new A.cN(B.beN,!1)
B.bdS=s(["Status da assinatura, identificador do produto, data de expira\xe7\xe3o","`purchaseToken` (token sens\xedvel usado para validar a compra junto \xe0 Apple/Google)"],t.s)
B.acp=new A.cN(B.bdS,!1)
B.bbo=s(['**"App" or "Fintab":** the Fintab mobile application for iOS and Android, including all future versions.','**"You" / "User":** the individual who downloads, installs, or uses Fintab.','**"Pro":** the paid subscription plan that unlocks premium features.','**"Store":** Apple App Store (iOS) or Google Play Store (Android).'],t.s)
B.acq=new A.cN(B.bbo,!1)
B.bc4=s(["**Cloud Firestore:** region `southamerica-east1` (S\xe3o Paulo, Brazil).","Firebase operational backups and logs may be processed in other Google Cloud regions under Standard Contractual Clauses, covering any international transfers under GDPR (Art. 46) and LGPD (Art. 33, II).","Local data stays on your device only (Keychain/Keystore + SharedPreferences)."],t.s)
B.acr=new A.cN(B.bc4,!1)
B.RB=s(["**iPhone/iPad:** Ajustes \u2192 [seu nome] \u2192 Assinaturas \u2192 Fintab Pro \u2192 Cancelar Assinatura","**Android:** Google Play Store \u2192 \u2630 \u2192 Assinaturas \u2192 Fintab Pro \u2192 Cancelar"],t.s)
B.acs=new A.cN(B.RB,!0)
B.beE=s(["A assinatura \xe9 **renovada automaticamente** ao final de cada per\xedodo pelo mesmo valor.","Para evitar a renova\xe7\xe3o, cancele **at\xe9 24 horas antes** do t\xe9rmino do per\xedodo atual.","A cobran\xe7a ocorre na sua conta da loja (Apple ou Google) na confirma\xe7\xe3o da compra e a cada renova\xe7\xe3o."],t.s)
